msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Servitude"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"All life is meant to serve us, build a thriving Empire by exploiting the "
"[locked2/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GameConceptSlaves]Slaves[/hyperlink] resource, "
"use them as {GLOBAL.UNITS.RABBLESLAVE_UNIT.Hyperlink} or crack the {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.PAIN_LASH.Hyperlink} to make all obey your rule."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@AUTHOR@NAME"
msgstr "Umbra the Ruined, 2nd seat within the Cabal"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@AUTHOR@DESC"
msgstr ""
"“And out of that hopeless attempt has come nearly all that we call written "
"history — family, money, power, ambition, war, kings and their slaves — this "
"long terrible wheel of life, always pushing man to exploit their equals, so "
"they may feel value in their own existance..”"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@Name"
msgstr "Task Master"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIGHTER.Hyperlink} unit specialized in using pain as "
"their voice."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@Unit@Skill"
msgstr "Whip of Command"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@Unit@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Crack your whip to issue an order, target friendly units in a 1-hex cone: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]Suffers 10 {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]Gain 2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Gain "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.HASTENED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr "Slave Soldiers"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@Unit@Skill2"
msgstr "Forced Conscription"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill1@Unit"
msgstr ""
"This unit has been forced into taking part of this battle: [bulletlist] "
"[bullet/]Starts the Battle with -20 {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]Is mostly Immune to any additional {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept."
"Hyperlink} changes."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill2@Name"
msgstr "Recruit Slaves"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill2@SKILL@Name"
msgstr ""
"Spend [locked2/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GameConceptSlaves]Slaves[/hyperlink] to "
"enchant stack leader, raising 2 {GLOBAL.UNITS.RABBLESLAVE_UNIT.Hyperlink} at "
"the start of your next battle."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr "Slave Economy"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill3@Name"
msgstr ""
"Introduce forced labor into target {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}, for 5 "
"{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}: [bulletlist] [bullet/]+60 {GLOBAL."
"StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+30 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept."
"Hyperlink}. [bullet/]-20 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill3@Skill@Name"
msgstr "Chains of Enslavement"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill3@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.INVULNERABLE.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"SUBDUED.Hyperlink} to target Tier II unit or lower suffering from: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROZEN.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.STUNNED.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]On failure suffers -25 {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill3@Desc"
msgstr "Dominion of Slavery"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill2@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Unlocks the [locked2/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GameConceptSlaves]Slaves[/"
"hyperlink] resource, earned by fighting battles, raiding provinces or "
"capturing units. \n"
"\n"
"[locked2/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GameConceptSlaves]Slaves[/hyperlink] are mainly "
"used for drafting expendable units and improving the empire economy."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill4@Name"
msgstr "[locked2/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GameConceptSlaves]Slaves[/hyperlink]"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill4@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Captive lives at your disposal, used to draft units or improve your economy."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill5@Name"
msgstr "Slave Infantry Commander"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill5@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Enchant stack leader to raise 2 {GLOBAL.UNITS.RABBLESLAVE_UNIT.Hyperlink} "
"for your next battle."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill6@Name"
msgstr "Slave Infantry"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill6@DESC"
msgstr "Dominion over the Weak"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@Skill6@Group"
msgstr "2"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@PANTHEON@NAME"
msgstr "Ascension: Supreme Authority"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@PANTHEON@NAME2"
msgstr ""
"This unit considers itself the rightful authority over those it deems weak: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+25% damage against Tier I and Tier II units. "
"[bullet/]Gain the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PAIN_LASH.Hyperlink} ability."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@PANTHEON@NAME3"
msgstr ""
"This unit considers itself the rightful authority over those it deems weak: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+25% damage against Tier I and Tier II units."

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@PANTHEON@NAME4"
msgstr "Dominion over the Weak"

msgid "TOME@SERVITUDE@PANTHEON@NAME5"
msgstr ""
"Grants enchanted units: [bulletlist] [bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"MASTER_OVERLORD2.Hyperlink}, which improves damage against low Tier units."

